- !<Text/0fd9bf5e-b10b-445b-9813-bf5edd01412c>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Think Out Loud is a Connected Lens that helps you start conversations with the people around you.
    
    Pinch Multiplayer to join a shared session with people nearby, or Solo to try it on your own.
    
    Turn your right palm toward you to open the menu, then write a status that floats in a bubble above your head.
    
    Pinch someone else's bubble to send a connection request they can accept or reject.
